### Conclusion

By using TestNG's `@DataProvider` annotation, you can easily implement data-driven testing in your integration tests. This approach allows you to test multiple scenarios efficiently and ensures that your service behaves correctly under various conditions. TestNG provides a flexible and powerful framework for data-driven testing, making it a great choice for comprehensive testing strategies.

